Package: com.duoface.carplay.mapownerexport
Name: DuoFace CarPlay Maps Log Export
Version: 0.0.1~jsonl1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Maintainer: DuoFace Independent
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0)
Description: Standalone iPhone app to share read-only live CarPlayApp Maps scene/VC/host JSONL diagnostic collected by separate DuoFace native scene probe. No network, no scene mutation, no SpringBoard or CarPlay injection. Sileo install/rollback independent of working DuoFace player.
